//Time Capsule
"timeCapsule" "When Hero 1 and the rest of the Omega team accepted their mission to the Rikti home dimension, they knew they likely wouldn’t be coming back. They put together this time capsule to hold items of personal importance to themselves. The items are simple things: letters to their children, old high school photos, things to help people remember who they were. This time capsule has been preserved as a memorial to their brave sacrifice."
